config RUST_CEC
	tristate "Rust CEC driver (Phase 5 — safe wrapper)"
	depends on RUST && CEC_CORE
	help
	  Rust reimplementation of the CEC transmit path.

	  Demonstrates compile-time prevention of CVE-2023-52846 (UAF):
	    - AtomicBool replaces plain bool completed
	    - Arc<CecData> prevents kfree while workqueue holds a reference
	    - Drop trait guarantees unconditional cancel (no if-guard)

	  To compile as a module, choose M here: the module will be called rust_cec.

	  If unsure, say N.
